# Google Maps API Key for Android (restricted to org.beanpool.pillar)
# Get a key from Google Cloud Console and paste it here
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your-api-key-here

# BeanPool's key vault for this build (utils/vault.ts): its address and its public keys, pinned. Public, not secret.
# Ticket keys: 64 hex characters each; deposit keys: base64url; comma-separated, newest first. Leave all three out
# and members' sign-in copies stay at their community, exactly as before the vault; set some but not all and the build
# stops (app.config.js). Until the custodians' parts are reshared, only a TEST vault's values go here: never point a
# real build at a live vault. A vault build is also blocked until (see PR #1336):
#   - the vault signs its releases and deposit receipts (review finding 4);
#   - global's door accepts vault tickets, V5 (finding 5);
#   - a member whose only copy is still at a community can get back in (finding 3): a vault build restores only
#     through the vault, and the move card shows only in Settings;
#   - a phone told "no copy" learns of a copy the member makes later on another phone (confirmation N1): today only a
#     Settings visit, a deposit or a restore on that phone does, and at rollout every phone starts at "no copy";
#   - a 2xx status answer that isn't a status is not recorded as "no copy" (confirmation N2);
#   - the custodians' parts are reshared, and the parked guide pages ship with it (GitHub issue #1349,
#     https://github.com/beanpool-org/beanpool/issues/1349).
# EXPO_PUBLIC_BEANPOOL_VAULT_URL=https://vault.example.org
# EXPO_PUBLIC_BEANPOOL_VAULT_TICKET_KEYS=
# EXPO_PUBLIC_BEANPOOL_VAULT_DEPOSIT_KEYS=
